  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the National HIV response, with focus on key populations and alignment with international targets - El Salvador (01-Jan-2025-31-Dec-2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El Salvador, HIV, Plan International, Inc. (Plan El Salvador)This program has the following goals: Promover y coordinar estrategias sostenibles e integrales para eliminar el VIH y las infecciones de transmisi&#xf3;n sexual como problemas de salud p&#xfa;blica&#xa0;en&#xa0;El&#xa0;Salvador / Promote and coordinate sustainable and comprehensive strategies to eliminate HIV and sexually transmitted infections as public health problems in El Salvador.. The objectives of this program are: Garantizar el acceso a condones y a la PrEP con un enfoque integral de prevenci&#xf3;n del VIH y atenci&#xf3;n a poblaciones claves y personas con VIH / Ensure access to condoms and PrEP with a comprehensive approach to HIV prevention and care for key populations and people living with HIV.  Brindar acceso  universal a la prueba de VIH y b&#xfa;squeda activa de casos para que toda persona positiva conozca&#xa0;su&#xa0;diagn&#xf3;stico. / Provide universal access to HIV testing and active case finding so that all positive people know their diagnosis.</narrative>
  </description>
